unison 1 1 0.1 0.1 0.5 0.7
env3 0.001 0.04 0 0.03
noise 0.1 0.9
routes 8
route 1 2 3
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
route 6 10 0.4
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 1 0.375 0.5 0.4 0.22
reverb 0 0.55 0.45 0.28
dist 1 0 0.2 0.3
